        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RIBBITS is a voice-input based, voice-action cooperative platformer!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players control frogs that adjust their jump strength using the volume of their voices, and work together by connecting their tongues like ropes to overcome obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shout, cooperate, and team up with your friends to reach your goal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voice-Action Jump System</strong> <br>RIBBITS requires the use of a microphone. The height and strength of your jumps change depending on the volume of your voice input.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rope-Based Cooperative Platforming</strong> <br>Players are connected by their tongues, functioning like ropes. This connection must be used to pull each other and overcome a variety of obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Absurd Humor and Quirky Worldbuilding</strong> <br>The game features the silly charm of frogs and a low-poly art style, creating funny and ridiculous moments throughout the gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A New Form of Cooperative Experience</strong> <br>There are many areas that cannot be cleared without teamwork. Experience a unique form of cooperative play where voices and jumps come together as the core mechanic.<br><br><br>■ A microphone is required.<br>■ For a smooth multiplayer experience, a stable internet connection and another player registered as a Steam friend are necessary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
